{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33936","headline":"病中有人惠海蟹转寄鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"病中有人惠海蟹转寄鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绀甲青筐染菭衣，岛夷初寄北人时。\n离居定有石帆觉，失伴唯应海月知。\n族类分明连璅𤥐形容好个似蟛蜞\n病中无用霜螯处，寄与夫君左手持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}